 "sentences": [
  "This glowing painting hides a biblical flood.",
  "English artist George Frederic Watts worked on it for 5 years.",
  "It first appeared in 1886 under the simple title The Sun.",
  "Watts believed modern society suffered from a lack of moral values.",
  "He painted works about the Flood cleansing the unworthy.",
  "This stylized seascape aimed to evoke God in the act of creation without showing Him."
